source: crates/mito/tests/cli.rs
expression: text
---
Incrementar versión y publicar en GitHub

Usage: mito release [OPTIONS] [KIND]

Arguments:
  [KIND]  mayor: X.0.1; minor: M.X.1; hotfix: M.m.X (defecto) [possible values: mayor, minor, hotfix]

Options:
      --local            Sólo generar ZIP local, sin incrementar ni publicar
      --output <OUTPUT>  Directorio de salida (defecto: releases)
  -h, --help             Print help
